---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { athletes } from "../../data/athletes.js";
import { site } from "../../data/site.js";
---

<BaseLayout title="About | LRAC" description="Lower Raritan Athletic Club — New Jersey, established 2026.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">{site.name}</p>
      <h1>About</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="identity-section">
    <div class="section-inner identity-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Club</p>
        <h2>LRAC</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="identity-facts">
        <div><span>Location</span><strong>{site.location}</strong></div>
        <div><span>Established</span><strong>{site.founded}</strong></div>
        <div><span>Members</span><strong>{String(athletes.length).padStart(2, "0")}</strong></div>
        <div><span>Contact</span><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email} ↗</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section">
    <div class="section-inner story-grid">
      <div class="story-heading">
        <p class="section-label">About LRAC</p>
        <span>Sep 6, 2026</span>
      </div>

      <article class="story-copy">
        <p>There are often signs that the dream is done, gone, or dead. As if the spark has finally dimmed, graduation- whether from high school, college, a 5th year, or a 6th- is a reasonable sign that it is time to put the dream to rest. Yet, we believe that the spark was still alive for many of our peers, stomped out under the guise of growing up.</p>

        <p>This idea really isn’t about sport, but for us it is. This problem led us to each address the end of athletic dreams in our life’s blueprint and to answer: what does an athlete do when there is still a burning dream?</p>

        <p>When deep down, you know that there is more to give. Whether it be the Olympic Games, the Olympic Trials, the Boston Marathon, or a local 5k, it doesn’t really matter, but we found the solution: you don’t need to stop. So we’ve kept training. Our mission is to prove to ourselves that growing up doesn’t mean killing your dreams.</p>

        <p>The idea of the Lower Raritan Athletic Club is to maintain the benefits of a team while accepting some of the responsibilities associated with age. The name is inspired by the watershed that encompasses the land of Central Jersey where our club was founded. It represents New Jersey, but more importantly, it looks vague and tough on a singlet. So we’ll run with it.</p>

        <p>The difference between the LRAC and others is that we’re not pretending to be something we’re not. We’re not sponsored. We’re not creatives. We just want to train really hard and go fast.</p>

        <p>If you’ve read this far, hopefully a dream is alive within you. If it is, follow along.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="members-section">
    <div class="section-inner members-grid">
      <div class="members-heading">
        <p class="section-label">Current Members</p>
        <h2>Athletes</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="member-list">
        {athletes.map((athlete, index) => (
          <a class="member-row" href={`/athletes/${athlete.slug}`}>
            <span class="member-number">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
            <strong>{athlete.name}</strong>
            <span class="sport">{athlete.sport}</span>
            <span class="location">{athlete.location}</span>
            <span class="arrow">→</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .identity-section { padding: 66px 0 74px; background: var(--beige); border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .identity-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr; gap: 58px; }
  .identity-grid h2 { margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: clamp(48px, 5.5vw, 72px); line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .identity-facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .identity-facts > div { min-width: 0; padding: 18px 16px 17px 0; }
  .identity-facts > div + div { padding-left: 16px; border-left: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .identity-facts span, .identity-facts strong, .identity-facts a { display: block; font-family: var(--mono); }
  .identity-facts span { margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--gray); font-size: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .identity-facts strong, .identity-facts a { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.35; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .identity-facts a { text-decoration: none; }

  .story-section { padding: 82px 0 94px; background: var(--paper); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .story-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 760px); gap: 58px; align-items: start; }
  .story-heading { position: sticky; top: 92px; }
  .story-heading span { display: block; margin-top: 12px; color: var(--gray); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .story-copy p { margin: 0 0 26px; font-family: var(--editorial); font-size: clamp(21px, 2vw, 28px); line-height: 1.42; letter-spacing: -.012em; }
  .story-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .members-section { padding: 72px 0 86px; background: var(--paper); }
  .members-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr; gap: 58px; }
  .members-heading h2 { margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: clamp(48px, 5.5vw, 72px); line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .member-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .member-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0, 1fr) 150px 170px auto; gap: 20px; align-items: center; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
  .member-number, .sport, .location, .arrow { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .sport, .location { color: var(--gray); }
  .member-row strong { font-family: var(--editorial); font-size: 30px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1; }
  .arrow { font-size: 13px; }
  .member-row:hover strong, .member-row:hover .arrow { color: var(--mint-dark); }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .identity-section, .members-section { padding: 48px 0 56px; }
    .identity-grid, .members-grid, .story-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 26px; }
    .identity-facts { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px 20px; border: 0; }
    .identity-facts > div, .identity-facts > div + div { min-width: 0; padding: 10px 0 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); }
    .identity-facts span { margin-bottom: 7px; }
    .identity-facts strong, .identity-facts a { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.35; }
    .story-section { padding: 46px 0 54px; }
    .story-heading { position: static; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; align-items: baseline; }
    .story-heading span { margin-top: 0; }
    .story-copy p { margin-bottom: 22px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .member-row { grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr auto; gap: 7px 14px; align-items: start; }
    .member-row strong { font-size: 28px; }
    .sport { grid-column: 2; }
    .location { grid-column: 2; }
    .arrow { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1 / span 3; align-self: center; }
  }
</style>
